(6981190, 1053954, 127021, '<td valign="top">this is my top pick of the challenge along with another<br/>i like the processing and the idea is original.  i''m not sure if you hung the carrots or not...<br/>I can''t figure out what''s wrong with the hand.  OOF or a strange motion blur that''s impossible.<br/>Either way, nice execution of a good idea.</td>', 'this is my top pick of the challenge along with anotheri like the processing and the idea is original.  i''m not sure if you hung the carrots or not...I can''t figure out what''s wrong with the hand.  OOF or a strange motion blur that''s impossible.Either way, nice execution of a good idea.', '2013-02-18 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981191, 1053417, 127021, '<td valign="top">This is my highest pick of the challenge along with another.<br/>The idea is good, and for this challenge original.  Obviously reminiscent of the maxwell commercial.<br/>Execution is good with important attention to details, especially the angle of the photos on the wall.  the tilt helps the effect.<br/>overall great job.</td>', 'This is my highest pick of the challenge along with another.The idea is good, and for this challenge original.  Obviously reminiscent of the maxwell commercial.Execution is good with important attention to details, especially the angle of the photos on the wall.  the tilt helps the effect.overall great job.', '2013-02-18 14:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
