(6981214, 1053925, 158576, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot that really works well in b&amp;w. Taking away the color adds drama to the scene, removes distractions, and gives it a vintage feel. The only issue I have with this is the blown out detail outside the window.</td>', 'This is a nice shot that really works well in b&w. Taking away the color adds drama to the scene, removes distractions, and gives it a vintage feel. The only issue I have with this is the blown out detail outside the window.', '2013-02-18 15:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
