(6981278, 1053931, 113411, '<td valign="top">great find. It is difficult to see the fans. Maybe a close up, rather than a long shot would have worked to your advantage. I love the colors and composition and mood.</td>', 'great find. It is difficult to see the fans. Maybe a close up, rather than a long shot would have worked to your advantage. I love the colors and composition and mood.', '2013-02-18 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981327, 1053717, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s been such a long time since I listened to Blue Rodeo! Awesome stuff! I like the shot. It is a little blurry due to the low light! The light on the stage is very good!</td>', 'It''s been such a long time since I listened to Blue Rodeo! Awesome stuff! I like the shot. It is a little blurry due to the low light! The light on the stage is very good!', '2013-02-18 18:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981350, 1053848, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job with the sharpness at such a low shutter speed. The motion blur of the fan blades adds an extra dimension. I like how you can see the shimmer on the ceiling along with all the texture!</td>', 'You did a nice job with the sharpness at such a low shutter speed. The motion blur of the fan blades adds an extra dimension. I like how you can see the shimmer on the ceiling along with all the texture!', '2013-02-18 20:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981352, 1053711, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice little still life. I like the blue background. Nice choice. I think the light is a bit too diffuse and there should be some darker shadows to add a dramatic feel.</td>', 'Nice little still life. I like the blue background. Nice choice. I think the light is a bit too diffuse and there should be some darker shadows to add a dramatic feel.', '2013-02-18 20:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981354, 1053915, 10785, '<td valign="top">The motion on the drum stick is superb! Was that done with a strobe?</td>', 'The motion on the drum stick is superb! Was that done with a strobe?', '2013-02-18 20:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981356, 1053909, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes. I think shooting at another time of day could have gotten you more interesting light.</td>', 'Nice shapes. I think shooting at another time of day could have gotten you more interesting light.', '2013-02-18 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981357, 1053873, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wow! What detail!</td>', 'Wow! What detail!', '2013-02-18 20:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981358, 1053921, 10785, '<td valign="top">Is this move in any way related to "Jazz Hands?" Humor aside, I think the shot could use a bit more contrast. I like the creativity in meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Is this move in any way related to "Jazz Hands?" Humor aside, I think the shot could use a bit more contrast. I like the creativity in meeting the challenge.', '2013-02-18 20:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981361, 1053914, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here and I think it could have been taken a few steps further. I am not sure of the technique you used here, but I think you could have made yourself a human fan by using a long shutter speed and firing a strobe a few more times as you moved your body angles from one side to the opposite side.</td>', 'I like the concept here and I think it could have been taken a few steps further. I am not sure of the technique you used here, but I think you could have made yourself a human fan by using a long shutter speed and firing a strobe a few more times as you moved your body angles from one side to the opposite side.', '2013-02-18 21:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6981425, 1053417, 109227, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2013-02-18 22:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
