(6985886, 1053929, 135744, '<td valign="top">You describe the technique as "Bulb Pictures. 3 in 1. first white, second orange and third red. "<br/> <br/>I would love to know how you achieved this photo and was not sure what you meant. I wasn''t sure if this was related to the bulb mode on the camera or actual bulbs in a light - sorry if this is a dumb question.</td>', 'You describe the technique as "Bulb Pictures. 3 in 1. first white, second orange and third red. " I would love to know how you achieved this photo and was not sure what you meant. I wasn''t sure if this was related to the bulb mode on the camera or actual bulbs in a light - sorry if this is a dumb question.', '2013-02-25 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 0),
